      "settings": {
        "heading_text": "<high>Foldable & Space Saver<high></high></high>",
        "description_text": "The Ativafit F8 folding stationary bike’s scissor-like frame design allows it to fold compactly and be easily maneuvered for storage, saving space in your home.",
